    "title": "Nichols, Clark Named to Women's Basketball All-GNAC Squads - NewsBreak",
    "text": "By Anna Carter ,\n1 days ago PORTLAND, Ore. – The GNAC announced the 2026 Women's Basketball All-Conference Teams on Tuesday, with Northwest Nazarene's Trinidie Nichols and Kendall Clark earning postseason recognition. Nichols, a senior point guard from Post Falls, Idaho, was named to the First Team All-GNAC, marking the first such honor of her career.... Read full article\nRead in NewsBreak",
